== 2. instruments ==
instrument D_P by construction against max(sigbits, 1) <= P: 0 of 130 (W, P) differ
instrument literal path against fast path (W 4..10): 0 of 196 (W, P, op) counts differ, 0 of 290648 values differ
instrument results outside the word: 0
instrument BSHL10 histogram rows holding 2^W values (W 4..16, every k): 0 of 130 rows wrong
instrument BSHL10 literal walk against the histogram (W 4..10): 0 of 49 (W, P) counts differ, 0 of 110512 values differ
instrument BSHL10 witness: the two spellings differ at 0, sigbits(y) other than P + 1 at 0, of 104 (W, P)
instrument BSHL10 checks against 2^W * (W(W+3)/2 - 1) (W 4..16): 0 of 13 W differ; the formula at W + 1 equals the count at 0 (must be 0)
instrument BAND and bor pairs[P] against |D_P|^2 (W 4..10, every P): 0 of 98 differ; |D_(P-1)|^2 equals pairs[P] at 0 of 70 P in 2..W-1 (must be 0)
instrument BAND and bor literal walk of D_P x D_P against the histogram (W 4..8): 0 of 60 (W, P, op) counts differ, 0 of 516560 values differ
instrument BAND and bor results outside the word: 0
