time model 1.0 s bshl10 0.0 s band 0.2 s instruments 0.4 s sweep 0.7 s sweep2 0.1 s
VERDICT PASS: L1 (shl) and L2 (sar) hold in every case checked, in the model for W 4..16 and every P, and in the 64-bit sweep at P 53; L3 (BSHL10) holds for every x in the word and every k from W-1-P, W 4..16, and in the sweep for k 10..63; L4 (BAND) holds on every pair in D_P x D_P, W 4..10, and in the sweep; every control found counterexamples where it must: lsr, orbit and bor at every non-vacuous (W, P) and in the sweep, BSHL10's tightness at k = W-2-P for every P <= W-2 and every W, and k = 9 in the sweep
